# Plan before acting (all agents)

Mandatory order: **read docs → write plan → implement → verify** (never start with edits).

1. **Docs first:** pick the owning `docs/*.md` via `.cursor/rules/lupfr-code-to-docs-map.mdc` and read it before touching code (see always-on `lupfr-context-engineering.mdc`).
2. **Plan:** for any non-trivial change, write **`tmp/plan.md`** before the first edit — one screen max, sections `## Will NOT Change`, `## Drift Risks`, `## Verification Plan`. Trivial one-liners: <=3 plan bullets in chat instead.
3. **No scope creep:** do not exceed the written plan; update the plan first.
4. **Verify:** `bun run ci` green before claiming done.

Same contract for non-Cursor agents lives in repo-root **`AGENTS.md`** / **`CLAUDE.md`**.
